    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40002" root="نطب" body-key="n">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَطَبَهُ</span></b>  (aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَطُبَ</span></b> , inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَطْبٌ</span>, TA,) <i>He struck</i>
[or <i>fillipped</i>] <i>his ear with his finger.</i> (K.) ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">انطب</span></b> 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُذُنَهُ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنْقَرَ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بَلَّطَ</span>, signify <i>the same.</i> (AA.)

